"the " + str(entitlements_revoked_last_quarter) + " that came off" ^0
"  because a reviewer looked and said no : " ^0
"    " + str(revoked_by_a_reviewer_saying_no) ^0
"  because nobody answered : " + str(revoked_by_silence) ^0
